  "description": "My boyfriend and my best friend fell for each other while I was in a coma after a hit-and-run accident. To make matters worse, the moment I found out that the hit-and-run driver who killed my father was my best friend’s father. I made up my mind. I would use the affection of a man who was head over heels for me to exact my revenge. Little did I know I’d end up being manipulated by him to this extent. A fiery tale of wedding preparations involving a woman obsessed with revenge and a man obsessed with her. \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
